summary: Validate writing CPU list to osnoise tracing file with at least 128 processors
description: |-
    regression check of https://issues.redhat.com/browse/RHEL-86520
    This test checks whether the system has at least 128 logical processors
    and attempts to write CPUs 0-100 to the /sys/kernel/tracing/osnoise/cpus file.
contact: Chang Yin <cyin@redhat.com>
test: bash ./runtest.sh
framework: shell
duration: 10m
